      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR NUGGET (1) goes very well this course and distance starting seven times for three wins and three minors. In the money last time at this track (22.13) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length third. With a clean break looks hard to beat. BENTLEY KRISTOFF (8) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (25.44) at this track in a Grade 5 over 457m. Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. One of the key runners again. CASH RIOT (7) goes very well this course and distance starting 11 times for four wins and three minors. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (25.38) in a Grade 4/5 over 457m at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. HOOKED ON KISSES (2) generally performs well here at this distance.",
